    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You come into your shift as a darkroom worker who develops film from customers.\u00a0 The room is lit by the eerie red tint of safelights.\u00a0 As you process each photo, something emerges\u00a0\u2014 not just from the images, but from the shadows around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkroom is a short experimental horror experience that tells its story through photographs you develop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each image reveals fragments of a disturbing narrative\u00a0\u2014 blurring the line between memory and reality.\u00a0 There are no monsters chasing you.\u00a0 No combat.\u00a0 Just you, the film, and the growing dread that something isn't right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Horror - Built around tensions, isolation, and subtle unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Through Imagery - Interpret unsettling photos to uncover a hidden truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental Design - A non-traditional narrative that invites curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang photos to dry in the order that best uncovers the story to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short experience designed to be completed in half an hour.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A camera can capture what the eye can't see.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You come into your shift as a darkroom worker who develops film from customers.\u00a0 The room is lit by the eerie red tint of safelights.\u00a0 As you process each photo, something emerges\u00a0\u2014 not just from the images, but from the shadows around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkroom is a short experimental horror experience that tells its story through photographs you develop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each image reveals fragments of a disturbing narrative\u00a0\u2014 blurring the line between memory and reality.\u00a0 There are no monsters chasing you.\u00a0 No combat.\u00a0 Just you, the film, and the growing dread that something isn't right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Horror - Built around tensions, isolation, and subtle unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Through Imagery - Interpret unsettling photos to uncover a hidden truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental Design - A non-traditional narrative that invites curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang photos to dry in the order that best uncovers the story to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short experience designed to be completed in half an hour.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A camera can capture what the eye can't see.</strong></p>",
